    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201103/2022011030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の俳優",
    "text": "そうだな……台本では義兄である信重に\r\n想いを寄せる妹のお敬、となってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "信重役の俳優",
    "text": "けど、その想いは恋心なのか、と問われると\r\nそれはどうかなと思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022011030080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "えっ……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202201103/2022011030080"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
